  "sourceTitle": "How Condé Nast built multimodal video discovery with Amazon Bedrock",
  "sourceBodyHash": "05b33588b6844eefa9e29a5165d8f7738fe0c3f83d3d1fc0fc7f849bb10ead10",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-29T22:33:47.120829Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-30T02:28:41.688945Z",
  "totalBlocks": 67,
  "translatedBlocks": 66,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8056e72e0db30d87",
      "translationZh": "Condé Nast 的编辑团队此前缺乏快速进行多模态视频检索的方法。他们在执行每个内容检索任务时平均需要花费 250 分钟，手动翻阅超过 140,000 个视频的库。他们依赖标题和描述来寻找相关的片段。在市场响应速度直接决定收入获取能力的媒体环境中，这一过程在 Vogue、GQ、Vanity Fair 和 Wired 等品牌中造成了可衡量的运营阻力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "654bd2c7f11c3b2b",
      "translationZh": "核心问题是结构性的：现有的搜索工具无法查看视频内容内部。团队依赖于机构知识来定位资产，这在特定人员无法提供服务时造成了单点故障。与此同时，由于标题或描述中的关键词无法将其与编辑实际运行的查询联系起来，未被充分利用的内容便静静地躺在档案库中无法被发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49759f8883fa19b5",
      "translationZh": "为了解决这个问题，Condé Nast 与 AWS 生成式 AI 创新中心 (GenAIIC) 合作，构建了一个由 AI 驱动的多模态视频检索解决方案。该解决方案基于 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon OpenSearch Service 构建，可在视频转录文本、视觉元素和音频上运行基于意图的语义搜索。团队选择了 TwelveLabs Marengo 嵌入模型，因为它具有联合编码视觉、音频和转录信号的原生能力。Marengo 为下文所述的所有五项功能提供了动力。这使每个任务的检索时间从 250 分钟缩短到了 2 分钟以内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b7521b1dd9c703e",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将描述其架构，解释我们为何做出特定的技术选择，并分享该解决方案带来的业务成果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4da14487f54d3340",
      "translationZh": "为何选择语义搜索（以及为何采用此架构）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d014333242b0c6f",
      "translationZh": "当团队界定问题范围时，有两个约束条件塑造了解决方案的设计。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82d6937ed7d00d3c",
      "translationZh": "首先，关键词搜索从根本上是不够的。编辑团队不会搜索“yoga_tutorial_march_2024.mp4”。相反，他们会搜索“带有宁静背景的初学者瑜伽内容”或“时装周幕后时刻”。搜索层需要理解意图，而不是匹配字符串。这直接指向了能够跨模态（视觉、音频和转录文本）捕捉语义含义的向量嵌入。仅靠人工编写的元数据无法提供那种程度的理解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af006fef19acd6c4",
      "translationZh": "其次，视频库规模足够大（超过 140,000 个视频），因此任何解决方案都需要将生成嵌入的高成本、计算密集型工作与提供搜索结果的低延迟工作分离。单体架构将迫使人们在摄取吞吐量和查询响应速度之间进行权衡。将它们解耦意味着每个平面都可以独立进行扩展、故障处理和演进。这一决定在回填处理期间被证明是至关重要的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f19a861b3d6363dc",
      "translationZh": "这两个约束促成了该解决方案的核心设计：由 Amazon Bedrock 上的 TwelveLabs Marengo 模型生成的多模态向量嵌入，索引在 Amazon OpenSearch Service 中，并通过专门构建的查询层进行提供。该查询层将自然语言转换为向量搜索并返回精确的时间戳。我们通过 Amazon Bedrock 访问 Marengo，因为 Bedrock 通过单一 API 提供了一系列基础模型 (FMs)。它还应用了 AWS 治理控制，包括用于访问控制的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)、用于网络隔离的 Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (Amazon VPC) 以及用于可审计性的 AWS CloudTrail。这种组合让团队能够采用专门的嵌入模型，而无需构建或运营自己的模型服务基础设施。对于向量索引，Amazon OpenSearch Service 提供具有多可用区 (multi-AZ) 复制和用于混合查询的元数据过滤功能的托管 k-最近邻 (k-NN) 搜索。这使得团队能够在无需管理底层搜索集群的情况下，对超过 140,000 个视频进行低延迟的相似性搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "613371017041c286",
      "translationZh": "解决方案能力",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc2a39abe58247fe",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案为编辑团队提供了一种与视频库交互的根本不同的方式。通过该解决方案可以使用以下功能：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aca8e5a1d28c5b49",
      "translationZh": "基于意图的搜索：用户使用自然语言描述其需求（例如，“初学者瑜伽内容”或“关于可持续发展的名人访谈”），并获得带有精确时间戳且在上下文相关地相关的剪辑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "902247eb4f4f6531",
      "translationZh": "多模态理解：搜索同时涵盖视频转录文本、视觉元素和音频。通过所说内容、所见内容或所听内容即可发现视频片段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa848870b9f1b9e7",
      "translationZh": "基于图像的查询：用户可以上传参考图像，以在存档中查找视觉相似的内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f30916ff83facd8f",
      "translationZh": "时间戳精度：结果能够精准定位视频中的确切时刻，从而无需观看整个片段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7e83803632994b",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了高层架构，显示了摄取与索引平面以及查询与服务平面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feca0b77364bedbb",
      "translationZh": "图 1：多模态视频发现解决方案的高层架构，显示了摄取与索引平面以及查询与服务平面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "01350c465e276b72",
      "translationZh": "架构详解",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c84fc487670b565",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案由两个解耦的平面组成：一个使视频可搜索的异步摄取流水线，以及一个处理用户查询的同步服务层。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eb402dea9526fba4",
      "translationZh": "摄取与索引平面",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00baf562ddcbee1b",
      "translationZh": "当新视频上传时，将执行以下序列：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6cee0f78120ba34",
      "translationZh": "上传：视频进入存放源视频的 Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 存储桶（在图中为 Video Outputs）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6bc8ce98e74fecc",
      "translationZh": "编排：新上传会触发一个事件（在图中为 Video Search Events）。该事件将视频的元数据推送到摄取流程中并协调流水线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5d895d45c6e5ecc",
      "translationZh": "预处理：摄取服务验证视频并提取元数据（格式、时长、分辨率）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fba50cf39f6e1da5",
      "translationZh": "分块：运行在 Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 配合 AWS Fargate 上的同一摄取服务将视频分割成片段。一个 Auto Scaling 组通过在多个可用区进行水平扩展，以并行处理这些分块。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c57c99283b17f539",
      "translationZh": "嵌入生成：每个分块通过异步调用，在 Amazon Bedrock 上使用 TwelveLabs Marengo 嵌入模型进行处理。Marengo 生成多模态向量嵌入，从视觉、音频和转录维度捕捉每个片段的语义内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c7c4f84c5097f47",
      "translationZh": "索引：生成的嵌入被写入 Amazon S3 存储桶以保证持久性（即图中的 Video Embeddings），并被索引到 Amazon OpenSearch Service 集群中，用于向量相似度搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29773fbbbf9bb940",
      "translationZh": "该流水线是事件驱动的，并实现了端到端的编排。这为团队提供了每一步的重试逻辑、跨分块的并行处理以及用于调试的全程可追溯性。在最初 140,000 个视频的回填过程中，团队重度依赖了这些功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b88d29a9325b87d6",
      "translationZh": "查询与服务平面",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c060691f1bf0ef2",
      "translationZh": "当用户执行搜索时，将执行以下序列：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78442d3054e2bf9e",
      "translationZh": "请求路由：请求通过互联网网关进入 VPC，并到达外部 Application Load Balancer (ALB)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc6a3bc779fb542c",
      "translationZh": "后端处理：外部 ALB 将请求分发到运行在 AWS Fargate 上的 Amazon ECS 前端服务。前端服务通过内部 ALB 调用搜索服务。Auto Scaling 组在多个可用区内对这两个服务进行扩展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39561431a43b0bd3",
      "translationZh": "向量搜索：搜索服务将用户的查询转换为向量嵌入，并针对 Amazon OpenSearch Service 索引执行 k-NN 相似度搜索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "219c38611c342f7a",
      "translationZh": "元数据富化：搜索服务从 Amazon DocumentDB（兼容 MongoDB）中读取视频元数据（标题、缩略图、引用）以富化结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5392a352b699ac95",
      "translationZh": "响应：组合后的结果连同相关的片段和精确的时间戳返回给用户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c04b023e297794e3",
      "translationZh": "高可用性 (HA) 设计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a96db9be873290b",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案全程采用多可用区设计。以下组件部署用于实现弹性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d448d9ccb85520c4",
      "translationZh": "Amazon OpenSearch Service：跨三个可用区进行同步复制（两个活动节点，一个备用节点）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b74790985ab3da9",
      "translationZh": "Amazon DocumentDB：跨两个可用区部署主节点和备用副本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cb7352eaaad99f6",
      "translationZh": "计算层：摄取服务、前端服务和搜索服务使用分布在不同可用区（Availability Zones）的自动扩展组（Auto Scaling groups），并由应用负载均衡器（ALBs）进行故障路由。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2d812930c302ee5",
      "translationZh": "网络隔离：计算和数据工作负载位于私有子网中。只有外部应用负载均衡器（ALB）可公开访问，出站流量通过 NAT 网关转发。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "862a14f74258b592",
      "translationZh": "康泰纳仕于2026年5月举办了一场基准测试研讨会，以量化影响。以下结果反映了康泰纳仕在该研讨会中的测量数据。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a47caf8fdd51731b",
      "translationZh": "内容发现时间降低了99.2%，从每项任务的250分钟缩短至约2分钟（该数据来源于前文提及的2026年5月基准测试研讨会）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "605de2b3b0bef90e",
      "translationZh": "手动视频审查工作量降低超过90%。团队收到带有精确时间戳的目标剪辑，而无需逐个视频进行快进浏览（如前述2026年5月的基准研讨会所述）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b1df72637d693c0",
      "translationZh": "约80万的年度运营节省，基于通过缓解组织内部重复的手动搜索而实现的生产力提升（该估算来源于前文所述的2026年5月基准研讨会）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f045cb3b551102cf",
      "translationZh": "改进的资产可发现性：先前未被充分利用的视频通过语义关联被发现，而仅靠元数据搜索无法识别。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2a77bc7417f3f2e",
      "translationZh": "加速收入获取：更快的发现意味着能够更迅速响应广告主的请求和销售机会，从而缩短从询问到变现的路径。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e7bf109d75fd7fb",
      "translationZh": "AWS团队与GenAI和TwelveLabs的与会者一起，帮助我们清晰简明地阐述了业务案例。我对在不久的将来在工作流目标上取得更多进展持乐观态度。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d21c4f9934241104",
      "translationZh": "— Billy Keenly，全球高级总监，创意优化，康泰纳仕",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94f347d8ddc971be",
      "translationZh": "在超过14万视频库中构建此解决方案时，出现了超出架构图所能捕捉的实际经验教训。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e30e2c9523d7c6fa",
      "translationZh": "早期的用户研究塑造了整个嵌入和查询设计。团队采访了编辑人员，以了解他们用自己的语言如何描述内容。这些对话确定了语义搜索的合适抽象层级。如果没有这种基础，系统就会风险化地为实际上没有人输入的查询进行优化。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "880c7454dffd0c5a",
      "translationZh": "在如此大规模的场景下，将数据摄取与查询服务分离是至关重要的。每个平面（plane）都可以独立演进、扩展和故障恢复。该方案已在生产环境运行六个月，在摄取管道重新处理回填内容或接收更新期间，生产搜索始终保持可用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfec41212b6ed159",
      "translationZh": "寻找合适的视频片段时长需要进行有意的实验。短片段会丢失上下文，长片段则会稀释语义信号。通过对真实编辑查询进行迭代基准测试，团队找到了在精确率和召回率之间取得平衡的时长。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4cd7432c5b032ce",
      "translationZh": "在这种规模下，异步生成嵌入向量是不可妥协的。如果对嵌入模型进行同步调用，在处理超过 140,000 个视频时将会产生瓶颈。通过 AWS Step Functions 进行异步调用，使得流水线能够在不阻塞的情况下处理积压任务，并且该模式目前仍被用于持续的数据摄取。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bc6ab524dddb1d7",
      "translationZh": "从第一天起就构建多可用区（multi-AZ）的高可用性，避免了昂贵的后期改造。对于编辑团队在整个工作日中依赖的解决方案而言，即使是短暂的停机也会直接导致生产力的损失。从一开始就将此特性内置，比后期再添加要更便宜。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95a3a21840ad0a55",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍了 Condé Nast 与 AWS 如何利用 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon OpenSearch Service 和 TwelveLabs Marengo 构建多模态视频智能解决方案。该解决方案将仅基于元数据的搜索替换为跨视觉、音频和转录模态的基于意图的语义搜索。其结果是：在超过 140,000 个视频的库中，发现时间减少了 99.2%，预计每年可节省 800,000 美元的运营成本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b46dcf0e6cd8baa",
      "translationZh": "这种模式适用于管理大型视频库的组织，包括广播机构、流媒体服务、体育联盟和企业媒体团队。随着多模态AI能力的演进，这种解耦架构能够适应不同的嵌入模型和内容类型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f585370152468f51",
      "translationZh": "了解更多关于 Amazon Bedrock 的信息，并查阅 Amazon Bedrock 用户指南以获取实施指导。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "782137363b93f3c7",
      "translationZh": "探索 Amazon OpenSearch Service 以及用于相似性搜索的 k-NN 向量搜索文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55fc79cdc8ed22a2",
      "translationZh": "阅读有关 Amazon Bedrock 上 TwelveLabs 模型的介绍，了解其多模态视频理解能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02643f48ed1cc4a6",
      "translationZh": "查阅 AWS Step Functions 文档，了解编排处理流水线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6df639093b13d395",
      "translationZh": "联系 AWS 生成式 AI 创新中心以讨论您的用例，或联系您的 AWS 客户团队。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51df5582c3db4254",
      "translationZh": "要开始在 AWS 上进行多模态视频发现，请访问 Amazon Bedrock 和 Amazon OpenSearch Service。要了解 AWS Generative AI Innovation Center 如何帮助您的团队构建 AI 驱动的解决方案，请访问 AWS Generative AI Innovation Center 页面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba7ff81450e86e13",
      "translationZh": "通过 Amazon Bedrock 上的 TwelveLabs Marengo 解锁视频理解能力",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d1c3d5cac39ec7e",
      "translationZh": "大规模多模态嵌入：面向媒体与娱乐工作负载的 AI 数据湖",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c09094aa8fdf83af",
      "translationZh": "我们要感谢以下贡献者在此解决方案中所做的工作：Shinan Zhang, Xiaoye Qian, Jessica Malca, Elvis Joseph, 以及 Jason Janetzke。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
